g, of oneness, of truth.","start":659.02,"end":669.2,"words":[{"text":"This","start":659.02,"end":659.26},{"text":"is","start":659.26,"end":659.46},{"text":"the","start":659.46,"end":659.56},{"text":"deepest","start":659.56,"end":659.88},{"text":"experience","start":659.88,"end":660.66},{"text":"of","start":660.66,"end":661.36},{"text":"belonging,","start":662.4,"end":663.52},{"text":"of","start":664.76,"end":664.76},{"text":"oneness,","start":664.76,"end":665.88},{"text":"of","start":668.6,"end":668.64},{"text":"truth.","start":668.64,"end":669.2}]},{"text":"You can continue this meditation.","start":694.7,"end":696.4,"words":[{"text":"You","start":694.7,"end":694.96},{"text":"can","start":694.96,"end":695.18},{"text":"continue","start":695.18,"end":695.6},{"text":"this","start":695.6,"end":695.92},{"text":"meditation.","start":695.92,"end":696.4}]},{"text":"By keeping your eyes closed and your attention at the top of your head and you can express once","start":698.48,"end":707.22,"words":[{"text":"By","start":698.48,"end":698.68},{"text":"keeping","start":698.68,"end":699},{"text":"your","start":699,"end":699.26},{"text":"eyes","start":699.26,"end":699.48},{"text":"closed","start":699.48,"end":699.86},{"text":"and","start":699.86,"end":700.2},{"text":"your","start":700.2,"end":700.38},{"text":"attention","start":700.38,"end":700.86},{"text":"at","start":700.86,"end":701.5},{"text":"the","start":701.5,"end":701.64},{"text":"top","start":701.64,"end":701.8},{"text":"of","start":701.8,"end":701.96},{"text":"your","start":701.96,"end":702.1},{"text":"head","start":702.1,"end":702.54},{"text":"and","start":705.56,"end":705.98},{"text":"you","start":705.98,"end":706.06},{"text":"can","start":706.06,"end":706.34},{"text":"express","start":706.34,"end":706.88},{"text":"once","start":706.88,"end":707.22}]},{"text":"more the desire within to connect with the whole. When you're ready you can open your eyes,","start":707.36,"end":734.38,"words":[{"text":"more","start":707.36,